# Prototype D3 R11 corpus — the file browser window (F2.11)
#
# one file browser: toolbar, a folder tree, a virtualized file list whose visible rows are declared as
# repeated delegate instances, a path bar and a status bar. The 24 rows are the visible window of a list
# that holds thousands of rows, which is what §20 requires a virtualized view to declare.

screen file_browser
  use Frame 3
  use Toolbar 1
  use Button 8
  use TreeView 1
  use Row 12
  use ListView 1
  use Row 24
  use Label 3
  use StatusBar 1
  use ScrollBar 2
  use Find 1
  use Dialog 1
end
